proach within nutrition, aimed at fostering better health through informed dietary choices and interventions.\",303\r\n791,NUTRICIÓN,FIBROSIS QUÍSTICA,Proper nutrition is essential for managing Fibrosis Quística due to the risk of malnutrition,288\r\n681,NUTRICIÓN,DESNUTRICIÓN,\"NUTRICIÓN and DESNUTRICIÓN are closely related concepts in the context of health and patient care. Adequate nutrition is essential for preventing desnutrición, particularly in critical patients. Nutritional support plays a vital role in both preventing and treating desnutrición, highlighting its importance in healthcare settings. Furthermore, proper nutrition is crucial for preventing malnutrition, especially among vulnerable populations such as the elderly. Overall, the relationship between NUTRICIÓN and DESNUTRICIÓN underscores the necessity of effective nutritional strategies to safeguard health and well-being.\",283\r\n714,NUTRICIÓN,OMS,La OMS establece directrices sobre nutrición para mejorar la salud pública a nivel global,278\r\n722,NUTRICIÓN,CANCER,Nutritional support is particularly important for cancer patients to meet their increased dietary needs,277\r\n801,NUTRICIÓN,CÁNCER,\"NUTRICIÓN and CÁNCER are closely interconnected, as cancer significantly impacts nutrition, making it a critical factor in the treatment and management of cancer patients. The nutritional intervention is essential to mitigate the effects of cancer on the patient's health, highlighting the importance of addressing dietary needs and nutritional support in cancer care.\",275\r\n823,NUTRICIÓN,HIPONATREMIA,Nutrition management is crucial in treating hyponatremia,275\r\n754,NUTRICIÓN,DIETA,Nutrition is the foundation for creating a diet that meets the needs of individuals with specific health conditions,274\r\n739,NUTRICIÓN,DIETA MEDITERRÁNEA,La nutrición es un campo que investiga los efectos de la dieta mediterránea en la salud y la prevención de enfermedades.,268\r\n779,NUTRICIÓN,DIARREA,Nutritional support is o